See that Rhipe.so is linked to the correct libprotobuf.so.6 (usually libprotobuf.so.6 is soft linked to the probotuf lib with the version).
In your case, the protobuf library might not be in the library load path.
Consider exporting LD_LIBRARY_PATH to include the path to where your protobuf was installed

