> --------------
>
>

Hadoop is not picking up your R shared libraries. Once again, do ldd /usr/local/lib/R/site-library/Rhipe/libs/imperious.so
Try logging in as hadoop and run the script
try logging in as yourself and run the shell script
Same results?

