Simpler examples(I should provide)

r <- rhlapply(10, fun=function(r) runif(r),ofolder="/test/one",mapred=list(mapred.job.tracker='local'))

## you can remove the mapred argument if it works in proper mode

rhex(r)

On my setup
rhls('/test/one")
shows the output
and
a=rhread("/test/one")
also returns the same information

Even in local mode it should store on the HDFS.

